# Google Play service account credentials.
#
# The key that can publish to the store. Never in the repository — set
# ANDROID_PUBLISHER_CREDENTIALS to its path locally, and keep its contents in a
# CI secret. The upload keystore is here for the same reason, and was in the
# repository once already.
